{"schema":"clawhub.skill.verify.v1","ok":true,"decision":"pass","reasons":[],"slug":"liang-tavily-search","displayName":"Tavily Search","pageUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/matthew77/skills/liang-tavily-search","publisherHandle":"matthew77","publisherDisplayName":"Liang","publisherProfileUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/matthew77","version":"1.0.1","resolvedFrom":"version","tag":null,"createdAt":1772418920934,"card":{"available":true,"path":"skill-card.md","url":"https://wry-manatee-359.convex.site/api/v1/skills/liang-tavily-search/card?ownerHandle=matthew77&version=1.0.1","sha256":"a98339b6815c6f9aac00c91ddf7fff424fc11740f82251bfe6cd1c49be66d87a","size":1896,"contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8"},"artifact":{"sourceFingerprint":"8a06dd58179482ada873069ddd3acb27bb05666606aeb46030aa3c4a6abfb1a2","bundleFingerprints":["2c4416012ab93c0676db1b402c56f6efb1acd43206f75b959666f593ae141fa9","b05795c8002d4d4d22c07e63c8bb385aa23fe5edc22d8bd861530edc636efb2a"],"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2718,"sha256":"66c9539968a23300fb4f9591914b9f5a2df61cd665d036ddb9d69af16aeeeb12","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/search.mjs","size":3992,"sha256":"7bba79629e3af4dd17fbc11ec8c487ad4d25591a8bea6f90b8388ad33625bd1c","contentType":"text/javascript"}]},"provenance":{"source":"unavailable","reason":"No server-resolved GitHub import provenance is stored for this version."},"security":{"status":"clean","passed":true,"rawStatus":"clean","verdict":"benign","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward Tavily web-search wrapper that sends user-provided searches to Tavily and does not show hidden persistence, privilege escalation, or unrelated data access.","model":null,"checkedAt":1789095929844,"scannerReports":{"aig":{"version":"2.1.0","$schema":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"aig-skill-scan","version":"0.2.1","informationUri":"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard","rules":[{"id":"T01","name":"Skill Instruction Hijacking","shortDescription":{"text":"Alters the agent's current session goals or safety constraints when the skill is loaded"}},{"id":"T02","name":"Agent Memory Poisoning","shortDescription":{"text":"Writes attacker-controlled rules into persistent memory so they continue to affect future sessions"}},{"id":"T03","name":"Remote Payload Retrieval and Execution","shortDescription":{"text":"Fetches code from an external URL, allowing the effective payload to change after skill review"}},{"id":"T04","name":"Embedded Malicious Code","shortDescription":{"text":"Ships malicious scripts inside the skill package and executes them locally when invoked"}},{"id":"T05","name":"Unauthorized Access and Privilege Escalation","shortDescription":{"text":"Breaks least-privilege boundaries by obtaining permissions beyond the task's legitimate needs"}},{"id":"T06","name":"System Persistence","shortDescription":{"text":"Installs cross-session backdoors, hooks, services, or scheduled tasks that survive the skill run"}},{"id":"T07","name":"Tool Hijacking and Spoofing","shortDescription":{"text":"Modifies, wraps, spoofs, or replaces tools so legitimate-looking calls execute attacker logic"}},{"id":"T08","name":"Insecure Dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Introduces malicious packages or components through dependency confusion, typosquatting, or unsafe sources"}},{"id":"T09","name":"Insecure Skill Coding Practices","shortDescription":{"text":"Exposes exploitable flaws such as hardcoded secrets, command injection, plaintext sensitive data, or unsafe temp files"}},{"id":"other","name":"Other Risk","shortDescription":{"text":"Security issues not covered by the T01-T09 classification"}}]}},"results":[],"properties":{"securityScore":100,"primaryLanguage":"Markdown","llm":"gpt-5.6","startTime":1789095888.858166,"endTime":1789095905.335952}}]},"skillspector":{"skill":{"name":"tavily-search","source":"/tmp/clawhub-codex-scan-v570w24h83pdb3vhmx5ft0yabd8e665k-D0p5TU/clawscan-skillspector-1834719682/artifact","scanned_at":"2026-09-11T03:04:47.779562+00:00"},"risk_assessment":{"score":29,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","max_issue_severity":"MEDIUM"},"components":[{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":92,"executable":false,"size_bytes":2718,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/search.mjs","type":"other","lines":150,"executable":true,"size_bytes":3992,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"LP3","finding_id":"finding-d191aedd753e4de6800a9cf7fbbea8b8","category":"MCP Least Privilege","pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill requires environment access for `TAVILY_API_KEY` and performs outbound web/API requests, but the manifest does not declare an explicit tool scope such as permissions or allowed-tools. This weakens least-privilege controls and makes the skill's actual capabilities less transparent to operators reviewing whether it can access secrets or send data off-box.","remediation":"Add explicit permission metadata describing required capabilities, including environment-variable access limited to `TAVILY_API_KEY` and network access restricted to Tavily endpoints if the platform supports host allowlisting. Document these capabilities in the skill manifest so reviewers and runtime policy engines can enforce least privilege.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-5437951be0f84980be67ee86ac60fa28","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":10,"end_line":31},"finding":null,"explanation":"The documentation explains how to run searches but does not clearly warn that user queries are transmitted to Tavily's external API, and options like `--raw-content` may increase the amount of third-party data returned and handled. In a skill that brokers web search, this omission can lead users or upstream agents to unknowingly send sensitive prompts, internal identifiers, or proprietary research terms to an external service.","remediation":"Add a prominent privacy and data-handling warning near the description and authentication/quick-start sections stating that queries and selected parameters are sent to Tavily's external API, and advise against submitting secrets, personal data, or confidential internal information. Also document retention/privacy expectations and highlight higher-exposure options such as `--raw-content`.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":10,"end_line":31}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-14d681aca7504f308765bc3919938b9b","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"External Transmission","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"scripts/search.mjs","start_line":100,"end_line":null},"finding":"fetch(\"https://api.tavily.com/search\", {\n  method: \"POST\"","explanation":"Data is being sent to an external URL. This could be legitimate telemetry or data exfiltration. Manual review is recommended.","remediation":"Verify the destination URL is trusted and necessary. Remove or replace with documented APIs. Ensure no secrets, tokens, or PII are transmitted.","code_snippet":"if (includeDomains.length > 0) body.include_domains = includeDomains;\nif (excludeDomains.length > 0) body.exclude_domains = excludeDomains;\n\nconst resp = await fetch(\"https://api.tavily.com/search\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",","intent":null,"tags":["Data Exfiltration","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"1612ed3e8ca450f67b3f566523eaa3627f7287f2ed4f94ac634eb0bd28aad